## Summary

Shipped a production-polished native Apple SwiftUI parity of `SessionListSection` at **commit `e83f8832`** — 16 source files (15 `.swift` + `.strings`) plus the gate log, **3435 insertions**, scoped strictly to the allowed `SessionListSection.*` files.

**Architecture (P4 convention, matching peer 0071-AlertsSection):**
- **Adapter/Item/Core** — pure Foundation projection: charger-category mapping, `filterAndSort`, session helpers (duration/avg-power/cost-per-kWh/battery-score/distance), pagination math, export-path builder — faithful ports of `chargingAggregation.ts` / `helpers.ts`.
- **Model/Seams** — `@Observable @MainActor` view-model over a P1/S8 `SessionListSource` seam; P1/S10 i18n facade; P1/S11 `view.opened` telemetry; formatting/units/exporter/deleter seams. No view-side networking.
- **Views/Controls/Actions/Row/Badges/Layout** — search, active chips, charger filter + sort pill bars, CSV/JSON export, bulk-delete toolbar (pluralized confirm), the full `ChargingSessionCard` row (score/category/energy/free badges, location, wrapping metrics via a custom `Layout`), and client-side pagination. Every state renders: **loading / empty / no-matches / error / content / stale / offline** — with VoiceOver, Dynamic Type, reduce-motion.

